    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but thats just what people say to make it better. it doesn't change the fact that the math doesnt add up. i spend all day interacting with screens and interfaces and people who just want something from me. it's all just input and output. if i'm just an error in a sequence, isn't the most logical thing to just... resolve the error? to just exit the program?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
